    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "Good_7",
      "field": null,
      "source": "@? I just want to say that I appreciate all the hard work you do for our household.$h",
      "translation": "@? Jen ti chci říct, že si vážím veškeré práce, kterou pro naši domácnost děláš.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "e3a0fd17e89476e27970f940acdc38ff840f76eebf1601f0e4d0ff124db363cc",
      "translationSHA256": "c8f04600f91694164cc68fb5126cf15bbc12df261538ec1f2c72b6563aec3949",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "Good_8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't worry about me... I know you've got a lot of responsibilities outside of the house. I'm fine in here by myself!$l",
      "translation": "O mě se neboj... Vím, že máš spoustu povinností mimo dům. Doma to zvládnu i bez tebe!$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "179f27b1f8362479543cceb8728f3bffe1962bb0354e7bcfcc41806d2095de0d",
      "translationSHA256": "19487414c4e65437aa43101741504ca727b956b7a1e6960b8f931792dcba2c86",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "Good_9",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh, I'm not bored... I'm just enjoying what we have here.#$e#It's a simple life, but I like it.$h",
      "translation": "Ach, nenudím se... Jen si užívám to, co tu máme.#$e#Je to prostý život, ale líbí se mi.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "65a9691795c9e07083e13f387f8b78e6af3042657025fa5ac8e6d93f5f046c61",
      "translationSHA256": "1e059b28db664126b878e9cb77b4e5063c1c4b57d728121087d36e194a7a704e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
